86,"r5_spy":-0.0391,"r20_spy":-0.0861,"r1_sector":-0.0096,"r5_sector":0.0046,"r20_sector":0.0172,"etf":"XLK"}}],"quotes":[{"c":"ASML 2019 Q3","e":"asml","d":"2019-10-16","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Peter Wennink","x":"And this further confirms 2019 to be a Logic driven year as we indicated at the start of the year, fueled by end-market applications requiring high performance compute, such as 5G and AI, which drives demand for leading-edge Logic.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/16/asml-holding-nv-asml-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"ASML 2019 Q4","e":"asml","d":"2020-01-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Peter Wennink","x":"Major innovation drivers, such as artificial intelligence, 5G, high performance compute, is driving a big data, creating new end user applications.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/22/asml-holding-nv-asml-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"ASML 2020 Q1","e":"asml","d":"2020-04-15","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Peter Wennink","x":"Logic customers are currently continuing to ramp their 7 nanometer and 5 nanometer node in support of end market applications like 5G, AI and high-performance compute.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/15/asml-holding-nv-asml-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"ASML 2020 Q2","e":"asml","d":"2020-07-15","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Peter Wennink","x":"…continue to ramp advanced technology nodes, 7 nanometer and 5 nanometer, in support of the build up of the digital infrastructure driving end market applications such as 5G, AI and high performance compute requiring leading edge equipment which have longer lead times and qualification schedules.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/15/asml-holding-nv-asml-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"ASML 2020 Q2","e":"asml","d":"2020-07-15","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Peter Wennink","x":"But when you look at the end market demand and the growing digital economy with secular growth drivers, like 5G, AI and high-performance compute, the demand for semiconductors for these products will continue and it will fuel future innovations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/15/asml-holding-nv-asml-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"ASML 2020 Q3","e":"asml","d":"2020-10-14","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Peter Wennink","x":"In Logic, customers continue to see strong demand for advanced nodes in support of the buildup of the digital infrastructure, which includes secular growth drivers such as 5G, AI and high-performance compute.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/14/asml-holding-nv-asml-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"ASML 2020 Q3","e":"asml","d":"2020-10-14","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Peter Wennink","x":"However, the ongoing transformation of the digital infrastructure along with the secular end market drivers such as 5G, AI and high power compute, will continue to fuel demand for advanced process nodes, both in Logic and Memory, which drives the demand for our products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/14/asml-holding-nv-asml-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"ASML 2021 Q2","e":"asml","d":"2021-07-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Didier Scemama","x":"Over the years, the semiconductor industry has never managed to effectively exert pricing power with that customer base for the reasons that we can imagine.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/21/asml-holding-nv-asml-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"ASML 2021 Q2","e":"asml","d":"2021-07-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Didier Scemama","x":"But now that -- and I'm not saying you should abuse that pricing power, but now that you are in a slightly different position, you're talking about the doubling of market demand over the next 10 years, etc. And given 